      <Notes>Two-server split: SQL-A hosts BizTalkMgmtDb, SSODB, BAMPrimaryImport, BAMArchive, BAMStarSchema, BAMAlertsApplication, BAMAlertsNSMain, BizTalkRuleEngineDb. SQL-B hosts BizTalkMsgBoxDb and BizTalkDTADb. Restores run in parallel on both servers simultaneously. ConfigFramework SampleUpdateInfo.xml must reference both SQL-A and SQL-B server names. Shared logins and SQL Agent jobs must be provisioned on both instances before cutover. Parallel restores reduce the maintenance window compared to a single-server sequential migration.</Notes>
